  "prefLabel": "Env-WC 104.01 Record of Council Actions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WC 104.01 Record of Council Actions.\n\n(a) Minutes shall be kept of council meetings and official actions taken by the council.\n\n(b) Minutes of council actions that are not confidential under RSA 91-A:3, II or RSA 91-A:5 shall be public records and shall be available for inspection during the council’s ordinary office hours as required by RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. #8976, eff 9-14-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wc100.html"
